<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling weakens versus dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling weakens versus dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was posted weaker versus the dollar on Thursday, exchanging at a mean rate of 599.0787 compared to 599.0490 on Wednesday, the central Bank of Tanzania said.</p>
<p>It added that against the pound, the shilling rose slightly to 979.9760 compared to 980.0472 on Wednesday.</p>
